# Polygon branch: "P" fixes the vertex/varying count at 4 (nverts derived
# from "P"'s own length); this Polygon's "N" supplies one normal (3
# floats) against the 4x3 = 12 floats that count implies. gman is expected
# to warn, clamp and keep going rather than read past "N"'s own
# allocation.
#
# A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
# desync convention."
Display "malformed_out.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.6]
Surface "matte" "Ka" [1] "Kd" [0]
AttributeBegin
	Polygon "P" [-0.4 -0.2 0  0.0 -0.2 0  0.4 0.2 0  -0.4 0.2 0] "N" [0 0 1]
AttributeEnd
AttributeBegin
	Translate 2 0 0
	Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
